{"`open(url)` is used without timeouts or error handling, which can indefinitely block workers on slow/unresponsive hosts and exposes an SSRF vector if `url` is user-controlled": 0.969829261302948, "Raw HTML embeds are rendered without any sanitization, which is a strong XSS risk - `import` sends remote `contents` through `absolutize_urls` and creates the post with `cook_method: Post.cook_methods[:raw_html]`, completely bypassing the cooking/sanitization pipeline": 0.9888511300086975, "Assuming `i.content` is always present can raise when the feed omits it - `SimpleRSS` may not set `i.content` for all feeds, so `i.content.scrub` can raise on `nil`": 0.9447609186172485, "Using `default: 1` for `cook_method` makes all existing posts render as raw HTML, introducing a behavior change and XSS risk since `Post.cook_methods` maps `0 => :regular` and `1 => :raw_html`": 0.9563543796539307, "In `EmbedController#best` using `params.require(:embed_url)` raises `ActionController::ParameterMissing` (400) when missing, but the spec expects a 404": 0.6102277636528015}